    {
      "source": "Creates a new <a href=\"../RepositoryBeanDefinitionParser.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.repository.config\"><code>RepositoryBeanDefinitionParser</code></a> using the given <a href=\"../RepositoryConfigurationExtension.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.repository.config\"><code>RepositoryConfigurationExtension</code></a>.",
