      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Base implementation of <a href=\"../RepositoryConfigurationExtension.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.repository.config\"><code>RepositoryConfigurationExtension</code></a> to ease the implementation of the interface.",
