      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Registers the given <a href=\"../RepositoryConfigurationExtension.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.repository.config\"><code>RepositoryConfigurationExtension</code></a> to indicate the repository configuration for a\nparticular store (expressed through the extension's concrete type) has happened.",
      "translation": "注册给定的 <a href=\"../RepositoryConfigurationExtension.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.repository.config\"><code>RepositoryConfigurationExtension</code></a>，以表明针对特定存储（通过扩展的具体类型表达）的仓库配置已完成。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Registers the discovered repositories in the given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/support/BeanDefinitionRegistry.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory.support\"><code>BeanDefinitionRegistry</code></a>.",
